Yeah! What is all that about? I think it might have to do with the 64bit
alignment - check out your /var/log/messages for un-aligned trap messages.
I think somebody has been bad in coding ping - I guess this is not serious
and will be patched soon (hint hint RedHat).

I must say I am impressed with the gnome integration - it even appears on
my UDB to which the window manager is exported! If I have one complaint it
