Has anyone come across smbmount/smbumount being incompatible with linux kernels in the 2.2.x realm? I have tried everthing including recompiling the latest version of samba under 2.2.9 to no avail. The furthest I get is the command completing successfully, but the share only shows up when you issue the mount command (i.e. not when issuing a df). Has anyone successfully gotten this to work? Please enlighten.

Todd
